ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi180: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with 4 edges on PLANE; PLANE: normal +Z, origin (0,0,0); 4-edge gap-chain square: each edge endpoint is offset by 1e-6 from the next edge's start, creating 4 tiny independent gaps; P0(0,0)->P1a(1,0) gap P1b(1.000001,0)->P2a(1,1) gap P2b(1,1.000001) ->P3a(0,1) gap P3b(-0.000001,1)->P0b(0.000001,0); gap_chain_edge_0..3 ARE all 4 edges IS the 4-gap-chain mechanism; FixGaps3d IS mechanism — bridges each gap independently, accumulating curvature deviations across the 4-bridge chain; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
